* Stringers

One of the most ubiquitous interfaces is [[⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000001⟫][⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000002⟫Stringer⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000003⟫]] defined by the [[⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000004⟫][⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000005⟫fmt⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000006⟫]] package.

⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000007⟫

A ⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000008⟫Stringer⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000009⟫ is a type that can describe itself as a string. The ⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000010⟫fmt⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000011⟫ package
(and many others) look for this interface to print values.

⟪GTI18N_0363038e_000012⟫
